## What this meta-repo is *not*

- It is **not** a monorepo. Each member is independently versioned and cloneable.
- It is **not** the source of truth for which version of each runtime is deployed. That role belongs to `flake.lock`.
- It does **not** vendor member-repo content into the superrepo history. The superrepo records member revisions as gitlinks and `.gitmodules` entries; each member keeps its own history.

