## Nix flake — package and host projection

The `flake.nix` at the repo root packages the current substrate tools and projects host-specific Nix outputs from registered computer-system records. The live host today is `vps-mini-cold-red-gate`, an Ubuntu system using Nix packages and user-level systemd services. NixOS configurations are emitted only for computer-system records that explicitly set `nixos-managed: true`.

Each registered computer-system with a `nix-system:` gets a `devShells.<system>.<computer-system-slug>` output for development and repair work{% if computer_systems %}:

